Z||000000||GTMike||09-28-2001||12:15 AM||||here is the story of my excessive display of speed.   <P>i just get out of the computer lab at school  i had been doing homework all evening.   i was stoped at a read light waiting to make a right hand turn.  when the coast was clear  or so i though. i reved it up to aobut 4 grand and droped the clutch and smoked the sh** out of the tires and fishtaild around the corner. no sooner then i shifted in to 2nd gear.  i saw the lights and heard the sirens.  so after i managed to get my seat belt on i pulled over.  <P>officer:  so do you always light them up in front of cops. <BR>me: aaa aaa.  no this is the first time.<BR>officer: whats  your hurry?<BR>me:  its a stress reliever  <BR>officer:  licens reg. and ins. please i'm going to site you for excessive display of speed.  i'll be right back.<P>he comes back<BR>officer: well i have taken a linking to you because i to like to lightem up every once in a while.  just try not to do it infront of a cop next time. <P>that made my day... <BR>||||reg||1
