Z||000004||Raydar||09-28-2001||09:01 AM||||Very cool!<BR>Several years ago, I was on my way to work in my Firebird. This is in downtown Atlanta.<BR>There was a taxi in front of me at the light, in the middle lane. <BR>As the light turned green, someone walked up to the car and started talking to him. He just sat there, blocking traffic.<BR>I whipped around him and smoked my tires through the intersection.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR>As I cleared the intersection, I noticed the cop sitting there at the corner. DOH!!!<BR>Of course he fell in behind me and turned on the "blues".<BR>He asked for my license, and asked why I fried my tires through the intersection. <BR>Told him I was just trying to get to work.<BR>He ran my license, handed it back, and told me to be careful. <BR>Very cool!<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
